  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">British International Investment (BII) Africa Resilience Investment Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Africa Resilience Investment Facility will support investment in harder-to-reach markets, including in low-income countries and fragile and conflict affected states. The Facility will stipulate conditions around the markets eligible for this funding with financing structures to enable investment in these markets. This will deliver against an enhanced offer to the world&#x2019;s poorest countries in line with Ministerial priorities for BII.</narrative>
  </description>
